Bharata asks how Rāma met vānaras and Hanumān begins tale --- Hanumān recalls exile Daśaratha death and Bharata pādukā rule --- Hanumān tells Virādha pit Śarabhaṅga heaven and Janasthāna slaughter --- Hanumān tells Śūrpaṇakhā mutilation Mārīca deer and Sītā seizure --- Hanumān tells Jaṭāyu death vānara sighting and Laṅkā consoling --- Hanumān tells Kabandha Sugrīva pact and Vālin killing for kingdom --- Hanumān tells worldwide search Sampāti word and hundred-yōjana leap --- Hanumān tells Aśōka meeting jewel token and Rāma resolve --- Hanumān tells bridge battle slayings divine boons and Puṣpaka return --- Bharata rejoices hearing Rāma comes tomorrow by Puṣya yōga